1
00:00:03,513 --> 00:00:06,157
The life energy of New Phlan

2
00:00:06,181 --> 00:00:09,920
is being devoured by 
the pool of radiance in Myth Drannor.

3
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:14,356
You can beat back 
the undead armies it spawns,

4
00:00:14,786 --> 00:00:18,840
but you cannot close the passage 
between the old pool and the new.

5
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,980
But passages run both ways.

6
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,620
From far away, someone opens a gate.

7
00:00:26,087 --> 00:00:29,700
You parents lost, but let's only help us!

8
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:33,240
Cries Athans, you leap to his aid.

9
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,240
But something is wrong.

10
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,960
The gate is unsteady.

11
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,460
Time stretches thin.

12
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:48,600
You reach Myth Drannor,
the gate collapses behind you.

13
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,273
Your adventure begins.

